Build a production-quality frontend prototype for a SaaS product called “Sentinel”.

Sentinel is an AI-powered intelligence layer for UK dental groups.

This is NOT a generic dental dashboard.
It should feel like:

Bloomberg Terminal
Linear
modern operational intelligence software
high-trust infrastructure
analytical and editorial

The UI must look premium, calm, and data-dense without clutter.

DO NOT use:

playful SaaS styling
bright gradients
cartoon illustrations
excessive shadows
rounded bubbly cards
startup-looking dashboards

The tone is:

serious
restrained
operational
analytical
executive-facing

The product combines THREE core systems into one unified intelligence layer:

Dentally PMS (practice management system)
GoHighLevel CRM (communications + lead tracking)
AI + Human phone call analytics

The product should visually demonstrate that all three systems are unified into one operational brain.

Use:

dark background (#0B0B0B / near black)
dark grey panels
amber accent color
soft white typography
tabular numerical fonts
dense but elegant layouts
subtle borders
minimal chart styling

The product should feel expensive and operationally critical.

