ASK SENTINEL

This is the hero feature.

Create an AI analyst interface.

Layout:

minimal elegant chat UI
dark editorial styling
analytical tone

Example prompts:

“Why did FTA rate spike last week?”
“Which practitioner has the lowest chair utilisation this month?”
“How many Invisalign leads from Meta Ads booked treatment plans?”
“Which patients have high treatment value but no follow-up booked?”

Responses should:

cite actual metrics
include charts inline
reference Dentally + GHL + calls together
feel like a senior analyst wrote them

Example tone:
“New patient acquisition increased 18% month-over-month, primarily driven by Invisalign enquiries originating from Meta campaigns. However, only 41% converted to booked consultations, significantly below the practice average of 58%.”

