IMPORTANT PRODUCT POSITIONING

The UI must communicate ONE core idea:

“Sentinel is the operational intelligence layer sitting across Dentally, GHL, and phone systems.”

Every major screen should reinforce this visually.

The product is not:

a CRM
a PMS
a call tool

It is the intelligence layer ABOVE them.

This is enough to get a VERY convincing prototype built quickly.

The strongest demo flow for clients would be:

Overview dashboard
Calls dashboard
Click into patient
Show unified timeline
Open Ask Sentinel
Ask:
“Why are Invisalign bookings down this month?”
Show AI-generated analytical answer pulling:
call outcomes
GHL lead source
Dentally bookings

That sequence will immediately communicate the value proposition.
